<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar management committee to review exports.</title>
<headline>EU sugar management committee to review exports.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee will continue on Wednesday to review exports to ensure that GATT (General Agreement on Tariffs and Trade) limits are being met, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;This is an ongoing review and no conclusion is expected,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
